These metrics do not come from your service code—they are from Istio's Envoy proxy.
✅ How to See Metrics in More Detail
1️⃣ View All Istio Metrics
Run:

bash
Copy
Edit
curl -s http://localhost:15014/metrics | less
🔹 This will show all metrics collected by Istio.

2️⃣ Check Sidecar Logs (for Requests)
bash
Copy
Edit
kubectl logs -l app=service-a -n default -c istio-proxy --tail=50 -f
🔹 This shows the raw logs of requests flowing through the sidecar.

3️⃣ View Istio Metrics in Prometheus
If Prometheus is running:

bash
Copy
Edit
kubectl port-forward svc/prometheus -n istio-system 9090:9090 &
Then, open http://localhost:9090 and run this query:

promql
Copy
Edit
istio_requests_total
🔹 This will show all HTTP requests handled by Istio.

